{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:38:29+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:38:29+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"SKAN Group AG","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"Switzerland","city":"Allschwil","website":"https://skan.com","employees":1694,"summary":"SKAN Group AG, together with its subsidiaries, provides isolators, cleanroom devices, and decontamination processes for pharmaceutical and chemical industries in Europe, the Americas, Asia, and internationally. It operates in two segments, Equipment and Solutions; and Services and Consumables. The company offers accessories, biological indicators, digital ventures, isolators, cleanroom, laminar flow, particle counter, personal protective equipment, safety workbench, transfer systems, and fume cupboard. It also provides digital solutions, lifecycle support, laboratory services, and SKAN labs. The company was formerly known as BV Holding AG and changed its name to SKAN Group AG in October 2021. SKAN Group AG was founded in 1968 and is headquartered in Allschwil, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"SKAN Group AG, en collaboration avec ses filiales, fournit des isolateurs, des dispositifs de salle blanche et des processus de décontamination pour les industries pharmaceutiques et chimiques en Europe, en Amérique, en Asie et à l'international. Elle opère dans deux segments : les équipements et les solutions, et les services et consommables. La société propose des accessoires, des indicateurs biologiques, des entreprises numériques, des isolateurs, des salles blanches, des flux laminaires, des compteurs de particules, des équipements de protection individuelle, des établis de sécurité, des systèmes de transfert et des armoires à fumées."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1715492992,"shares_outstanding":22483524,"traili